{"parse":{"title":"个性/血誓枪魂","pageid":9232,"revid":22523,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%A1%80%E8%AA%93%E6%9E%AA%E9%AD%82&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%A1%80%E8%AA%93%E6%9E%AA%E9%AD%82&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%A1%80%E8%AA%93%E6%9E%AA%E9%AD%82&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>血誓枪魂</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.A1.80.E8.AA.93.E6.9E.AA.E9.AD.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"血誓枪魂\"><b>血誓枪魂</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 血誓枪魂.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/22/skfkx3evotioyyb2awre3fe6bl0rk42.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E8%A1%80%E8%AA%93%E6%9E%AA%E9%AD%82.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/22/skfkx3evotioyyb2awre3fe6bl0rk42.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E8%A1%80%E8%AA%93%E6%9E%AA%E9%AD%82.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/22/skfkx3evotioyyb2awre3fe6bl0rk42.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />血誓枪魂\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"血色光辉\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">血色光辉</font></span></span>]。[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]减少时，点数转化为对应层数的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"杀气\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">杀气</font></span></span>]。行动开始时消耗所有能量，每消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>点获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"杀气\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">杀气</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]不为<font color=\"#ed7950\">0</font>时，最终伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"光辉军魂1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">光辉军魂1</font></span></span>]。防御提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，物防值的<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>附加在物攻上。自身[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]战斗开始时，减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">20</font>点；行动开始时，减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>点。<br />✦攻击前，若冲锋或移动大于等于<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格，则获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"不屈之枪\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">不屈之枪</font></span></span>]（持续2回合），每回合最多触发1次。<br />✦造成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]后，对目标施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伤口\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">伤口</font></span></span>]（持续2回合）。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%88%97%E5%A5%A5%E5%B0%BC%E5%BE%B7%E2%80%A2%E5%AF%92%E9%94%8B%E8%A1%80%E8%AA%93\" title=\"角色图鉴库/列奥尼德•寒锋血誓\"><img alt=\"头像 列奥尼德•寒锋血誓.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5e/psmyam389hualjbfd0utgnbr2hnjsbo.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">列奥尼德•寒锋血誓</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-le